    {"id":"saipem7-merger","date":"2025-07-24","announced":"2025-02-23","type":"merger","pending":true,"from":["saipem","subsea7"],"to":["saipem"],"title":"Saipem and Subsea7 agree to combine as Saipem7","detail":"Cross-border merger by incorporation of Subsea 7 S.A. into Saipem S.p.A., which would be renamed Saipem7 S.p.A.; Subsea7 holders get 6.688 Saipem shares per share (50/50 ownership), listed in Milan and Oslo. Approved by Saipem's EGM 25 Sep 2025; US HSR waiting period expired 31 Jul 2026; Brazil's CADE approved 4 Nov 2026 on condition that Seven Borealis is divested. Other conditions are still open; Saipem still reports as Saipem S.p.A. Shown at the merger agreement's signing; not completed as of Nov 8, 2026.","value":null,"sources":[{"title":"Proposed Combination of Saipem and Subsea7","publisher":"Saipem","date":"2025-02-23","url":"https://www.saipem.com/en/media/press-releases/2025-02-23/proposed-combination-saipem-and-subsea7","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Saipem and Subsea7 announce signing of the Merger Agreement","publisher":"Saipem","date":"2025-07-24","url":"https://www.saipem.com/en/media/press-releases/2025-07-24/saipem-and-subsea7-announce-signing-merger-agreement","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Saipem: Results of the Extraordinary Shareholders' Meeting held on 25 September 2025","publisher":"Saipem","date":"2025-09-25","url":"https://www.saipem.com/en/media/press-releases/2025-09-25/saipem-results-extraordinary-shareholders-meeting-held-25-september","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Saipem announces expiration of Hart-Scott-Rodino Act waiting period","publisher":"Saipem","date":"2026-07-31","url":"https://www.saipem.com/en/media/press-releases/2026-07-31/saipem-announces-expiration-hart-scott-rodino-act-waiting-period","kind":"primary"},{"title":"CADE approves combination of Saipem and Subsea7","publisher":"Saipem","date":"2026-11-04","url":"https://www.saipem.com/en/media/press-releases/2026-11-04/cade-approves-combination-saipem-and-subsea7","kind":"primary"}]},
    {"id":"2025-tungsten-explorer-to-teva","date":"2025-08-11","announced":"2024-02-06","type":"fleet","from":["vantage-drilling-international"],"to":["teva-ship-charter"],"title":"Vantage sells Tungsten Explorer to the TEVA joint venture","detail":"Vantage completed the sale of the Tungsten Explorer to TEVA Ship Charter after the rig's Congo contract, keeping a 25% stake and a 10-year management contract. The 2024 terms valued the rig at US$265 million, with TotalEnergies paying about US$199 million in cash for 75%.","value":"US$265 million rig value (US$198.75 million cash for 75%)","sources":[{"title":"Vantage Drilling International Ltd. Announces Completion of the Sale of the Tungsten Explorer","publisher":"Vantage Drilling International","date":"2025-08-11","url":"https://mfn.se/one/a/vantage-drilling/vantage-drilling-international-ltd-announces-completion-of-the-sale-of-the-tungsten-explorer-abbd8e61","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Vantage Drilling International Ltd. – Information Document (admission to Euronext Growth Oslo), section 6.5 History and important events","publisher":"Vantage Drilling International","date":"2024-10-28","url":"https://storage.mfn.se/c/aHR0cHM6Ly9hcGkzLm9zbG8ub3Nsb2JvcnMubm8vdjEvbmV3c3JlYWRlci9hdHRhY2htZW50P21lc3NhZ2VJZD02MzA0NzEmYXR0YWNobWVudElkPTI5MTk4Mg/vantage-drilling-information-document.pdf","kind":"primary"}],"conflict":false},
    {"id":"2025-odfjell-buys-deepsea-bollsta","date":"2025-12-15","announced":"2025-11-17","type":"fleet","from":["northern-ocean"],"to":["odfjell-drilling"],"title":"Odfjell buys Deepsea Bollsta from Northern Ocean (now Deepsea Bergen)","detail":"Odfjell Drilling, which had managed the rig since Q1 2022, bought the harsh-environment semi Deepsea Bollsta (ex West Bollsta, ex Bollsta Dolphin) from Northern Ocean, fully debt-financed, adding about US$355 million of Equinor backlog; it renamed the rig Deepsea Bergen. Northern Ocean used the cash to repay debt and kept Deepsea Mira.","value":"US$480 million (cash)","sources":[{"title":"ODL - Acquisition of Deepsea Bollsta","publisher":"Odfjell Drilling (via Euronext)","date":"2025-11-17","url":"https://live.euronext.com/sites/default/files/company_press_releases/attachments_oslo/2025/11/17/659811_Odfjell%20Drilling%20-%20ODL%20%E2%80%93%20Acquisition%20of%20Deepsea%20Bollsta%20.pdf","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Northern Ocean sells Deepsea Bollsta, significantly reduces debt","publisher":"FilingReader (Northern Ocean release)","date":"2025-12-15","url":"https://filingreader.com/news-wire/oslo/2025-12-15/northern-ocean-sells-deepsea-bollsta-significantly-reduces-debt","kind":"press"},{"title":"Odfjell Rig III Ltd bond prospectus (Deepsea Bergen acquired December 2025)","publisher":"Odfjell Drilling","date":"2026-06-19","url":"https://www.odfjelldrilling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/19-06-2026-or3-bond-prospectus.pdf","kind":"primary"}],"conflict":false},
    {"id":"2026-noble-jackups-to-borr","date":"2026-01-28","announced":"2025-12","type":"fleet","from":["noble-corporation"],"to":["borr-drilling"],"title":"Noble sells five jackups to Borr Drilling","detail":"Noble sold the Noble Tom Prosser, Noble Mick O'Brien, Noble Regina Allen, Noble Resilient and Noble Resolute to Borr (renamed Freyja, Forseti, Sif, Joro and Bestla), taking Borr's fleet to 29 jackups; Noble kept operating three of them under bareboat charters. Completion was announced January 28, 2026.","value":"US$360 million (about US$210 million cash plus US$150 million seller notes)","sources":[{"title":"Noble completes $360-million sale of five jackups to Borr Drilling","publisher":"World Oil","date":"2026-01-28","url":"https://worldoil.com/news/2026/1/28/noble-completes-360-million-sale-of-five-jackups-to-borr-drilling/","kind":"press"},{"title":"Noble Completes $360M Sale of Five Jack-Ups to Borr Drilling","publisher":"OE Digital","date":"2026-01","url":"https://www.oedigital.com/news/534995-noble-completes-360m-sale-of-five-jack-ups-to-borr-drilling","kind":"press"},{"title":"Borr Drilling completes acquisition of five premium jack-up rigs","publisher":"Borr Drilling (via Inderes)","date":"2026-01-28","url":"https://www.inderes.fi/releases/borr-borr-drilling-completes-acquisition-of-five-premium-jack-up-rigs","kind":"primary"},{"title":"About Borr Drilling (timeline: Jan 2026, Noble Drilling, +5)","publisher":"Borr Drilling","date":null,"url":"https://borrdrilling.com/about","kind":"primary"}],"conflict":false},
    {"id":"2026-eldorado-acquires-vantage","date":"2026-06-26","announced":"2026-05-29","type":"acquisition","from":["vantage-drilling-international"],"to":["eldorado-drilling"],"title":"Eldorado Drilling acquires Vantage Drilling","detail":"An Eldorado subsidiary merged into Vantage under Bermuda law for US$19.00 a share in cash; Vantage survives as a wholly owned Eldorado subsidiary and delisted from Euronext Growth Oslo. The release said Vantage keeps its name, but by Oct 2026 the business was presented as Eldorado Drilling (vantagedrilling.com now redirects to eldoradodrilling.com).","value":"about US$257.6 million (equity, cash)","sources":[{"title":"Vantage Drilling International announces agreement to merge with Eldorado Drilling AS","publisher":"Vantage Drilling International","date":"2026-05-29","url":"https://mfn.se/one/a/vantage-drilling/vantage-drilling-international-announces-agreement-to-merge-with-eldorado-drilling-as-5c2dba40","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Eldorado completes acquisition of Vantage Drilling International Ltd., creating a scaleable offshore drilling platform with enhanced capabilities","publisher":"Eldorado Drilling / Vantage Drilling International","date":"2026-06-26","url":"https://mfn.se/one/a/vantage-drilling/eldorado-completes-acquisition-of-vantage-drilling-international-ltd-creating-a-scaleable-offshore-drilling-platform-with-enhanced-capabilities-230f2912","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Eldorado Drilling home page","publisher":"Eldorado Drilling","date":null,"url":"https://eldoradodrilling.com/","kind":"primary"}],"conflict":false},
    {"id":"2026-borr-mexico-jv-jackups","date":"2026-07","announced":"2026-03-23","type":"fleet","from":[],"to":["borr-drilling"],"title":"Borr's Mexican JV buys five jackups from Paratus","detail":"BC Ventures, a new 50/50 joint venture between Borr and its Mexican partner CME, bought five jackups in Mexico (Oberon, Titania FE, Courageous, Defender, Intrepid) from Fontis Finance, a Paratus Energy Services subsidiary, with a US$237 million seller's credit and US$25 million cash from each partner; completion was announced on 29 July 2026, taking Borr's owned and jointly owned fleet to 34.","value":"US$287 million","sources":[{"title":"Borr Drilling acquires five jack-ups","publisher":"Offshore Engineer","date":"2026-03-23","url":"https://www.oedigital.com/news/537179-borr-drilling-acquires-five-jack-ups","kind":"press"},{"title":"Borr Drilling's Mexican JV completes purchase of five rigs for $287 million","publisher":"Offshore Energy","date":"2026-07-29","url":"https://offshore-energy.biz/borr-drillings-mexican-jv-completes-purchase-of-five-rigs-for-287-million","kind":"press"},{"title":"About Borr Drilling (timeline: July 2026, Mexico JV, +5)","publisher":"Borr Drilling","date":null,"url":"https://borrdrilling.com/about","kind":"primary"}],"conflict":false},
    {"id":"2026-eldorado-buys-deep-value-driller","date":"2026-09-10","announced":"2026-02-25","type":"fleet","from":["deep-value-driller-as"],"to":["eldorado-drilling"],"title":"Eldorado buys the drillship Deep Value Driller, outbidding Saipem","detail":"Deep Value Driller AS dropped an agreed US$272.5 million sale to Saipem (17 Feb 2026), which had chartered the rig since 2023, and sold it to Eldorado for US$300 million; Ventura Offshore manages it for Eldorado. The rig was built as Dolphin Drilling's Bolette Dolphin and bought by DVD in 2021 for US$65 million.","value":"US$300 million (cash)","sources":[{"title":"Deep Value Driller AS – Agreement to sell the Deep Value Driller to Eldorado Drilling for USD 300 million","publisher":"Deep Value Driller AS","date":"2026-02-25","url":"https://mfn.se/ob/a/deep-value-driller/deep-value-driller-as-agreement-to-sell-the-deep-value-driller-to-eldorado-drilling-for-usd-300-million-b18d361d","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Deep Value Driller AS – Successful completion of the sale of the Deep Value Driller to Eldorado Drilling","publisher":"Deep Value Driller AS","date":"2026-09-10","url":"https://mfn.se/ob/a/deep-value-driller/deep-value-driller-as-successful-completion-of-the-sale-of-the-deep-value-driller-to-eldorado-drilling-c6d5b8ac","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Saipem: Deep Value Driller AS decides not to finalize the agreement with Saipem","publisher":"Saipem","date":"2026-02-25","url":"https://www.saipem.com/en/media/press-releases/2026-02-25/saipem-deep-value-driller-decides-not-finalize-agreement-saipem","kind":"primary"},{"title":"DVD: Successful completion of the acquisition of Bolette Dolphin","publisher":"Deep Value Driller AS","date":"2021","url":"https://mfn.se/8228unk/a/deep-value-driller/dvd-deep-value-driller-as-successful-completion-of-the-acquisition-of-bolette-dolphin-b4f4cc1e","kind":"primary"}],"conflict":false},
    {"id":"2026-saipem-jackups-to-ades","date":"2026-09-15","announced":"2026-06-24","type":"fleet","from":["saipem"],"to":["ades"],"title":"Saipem sells its Saudi jackup business to ADES","detail":"Saipem sold Saudi Arabian Saipem Limited (owned jackups Perro Negro 7, 8 and 10; leased Perro Negro 11 and 13) to ADES, leaving it focused on deepwater and harsh-environment drilling. Saipem bareboat-charters Perro Negro 10 back for Mexico.","value":"US$285 million (debt-free/cash-free)","sources":[{"title":"Saipem has entered into a binding sale and purchase agreement with ADES for the divestment of its Shallow Water Drilling activities in Saudi Arabia","publisher":"Saipem","date":"2026-06-24","url":"https://www.saipem.com/en/media/press-releases/2026-06-24/saipem-has-entered-binding-sale-and-purchase-agreement-ades","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Saipem: divestment of Shallow Water Drilling's operations in Saudi Arabia completed","publisher":"Saipem","date":"2026-09-15","url":"https://www.saipem.com/en/media/press-releases/2026-09-15/saipem-divestment-shallow-water-drillings-operations-saudi-arabia","kind":"primary"}],"conflict":false},
    {"id":"2026-valaris-merger","date":"2026-12-01","announced":"2026-02-09","type":"merger","from":["transocean","valaris"],"to":["transocean"],"title":"Transocean to acquire Valaris (pending)","detail":"Transocean agreed to acquire Valaris in an all-stock deal (15.235 Transocean shares per Valaris share; about 53% Transocean / 47% Valaris holders) through a Bermuda scheme of arrangement, creating a 73-rig fleet. As of November 5, 2026 all regulatory approvals were in (DOJ and Brazil's CADE last, without conditions); shareholder votes are set for November 24, the Bermuda court sanction hearing for November 26, and closing is expected on or about December 1, 2026. Not yet completed.","value":"About US$5.8 billion (all stock)","sources":[{"title":"Transocean to Acquire Valaris","publisher":"Transocean and Valaris (GlobeNewswire)","date":"2026-02-09","url":"https://s23.q4cdn.com/956522167/files/doc_news/2026/02/Transocean-to-Acquire-Valaris_Press-Release_Final.pdf","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Transocean Ltd. Reports Third Quarter 2026 Results","publisher":"Transocean","date":"2026-11-02","url":"https://investor.deepwater.com/news-releases/news-release-details/transocean-ltd-reports-third-quarter-2026-results","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Valaris Reports Third Quarter 2026 Results","publisher":"Valaris","date":"2026-11-02","url":"https://s23.q4cdn.com/956522167/files/content_files/3Q26-Results-Press-Release_FINAL.pdf","kind":"primary"},{"title":"Transocean and Valaris merger secures all regulatory approvals ahead of December 1 closing","publisher":"Baird Maritime","date":"2026-11-05","url":"https://www.bairdmaritime.com/offshore/drilling-production/transocean-valaris-merger-regulatory-approvals","kind":"press"}],"conflict":false,"pending":true}
